          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "No, no, NO! We played already, precious, it knows we did. The riddles are all used up, gollum, all spent and swallowed. Come back when the week turns -- <CUSTOM6360>, yes, we counted -- and we'll have seven new ones, oh yes. Sharp ones. Hard ones. *It curls around its rock and glares.* Go away now. Leave us alone."
          }
        }
      },
