        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "Sss, it came back to us, precious! Good, good. The game is not finished, no -- seven we promised and seven it gets, not one less. *It rubs its long hands together.* Where were we? Yes, yes... listen close now."
          }
        }
