        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*It writhes on its rock, hissing and spitting.* It wins, it WINS! <CUSTOM6361> of seven, curse it and crush it! Sss... a bargain is a bargain, precious, even in the dark. Take it then -- take the present and choke on it! *It flings your prize at you and hunches jealously over the rest of its little hoard.* The game is done. Come back when the week turns, if it dares. Gollum, gollum."
