        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*It capers on its rock, hugging itself with glee.* It loses, it loses! Only <CUSTOM6361> of seven, stupid lost thing! No present, no precious, nothing for it but the long cold walk back up into the nasty light. Gollum! *It settles back into the dark, still chuckling wetly.* Come back when the week turns and we plays again. We likes winning, yes we does, precious. We likes it very much."
